:: day4_sleep
<div class="intimate"><span class="tag">The end of Day 4</span>
<<if $pov is "arjun">>You lie down on the cot that's yours. You keep feeling the ghost of the dupatta on your left shoulder and reaching for hair that isn't there   less than yesterday, but still. You think about Meera's arms and the geometry inverted, the small one for once. You set the alarm for 4:15 and turn it face-down under the pillow.
<<else>>You lie down in Room 304, underwire back where it lives, the pathology reading you're still behind on glowing on Priya's side. Meera's breathing has gone even. You can still feel where the tank sat between your knees, and the exact shape of a problem you solved with nine inches of reach you no longer have.

You set the alarm for 4:15.
<</if>>

Tomorrow, before dawn, again. It's a pattern now. Patterns get noticed.
</div>\
<<run setup.flag("arjun_slept_d4")>>\
<<run setup.flag("kavya_slept_d4")>>\
<<run setup.flag("day5_swap_planned")>>
