:: Day4Complete [nobr]
<div class="title-screen">
<div class="th">दूसरी चमड़ी पूरी</div>
<div class="te">End of Day 4</div>

<p class="lede">Arjun is back in Katraj replaying two hours of being held. Kavya is in Room 304, grieving a keyboard again, the underwire back in its usual argument with gravity. The second swap is complete and it felt almost routine   which is its own kind of alarm.</p>

<p class="lede">Nobody's cover broke. Priya logged the phone in the wrong place, Sneha logged the handwriting again, Rohit logged a second dawn absence. Small things. Individually meaningless. Cumulatively pointing somewhere.</p>

<div class="thought arjun">ARJUN   Coding <<= $stats.a_coding>> · Fem-comfort <<= $stats.a_femComfort>> · Rel Meera <<= $stats.rel_arjun_meera>> · Rel Kavya <<= $stats.rel_arjun_kavya>> · Drawn to female frame <<= $stats.a_sexF>></div>
<div class="thought kavya">KAVYA   Coding <<= $stats.k_coding>> · Masc-comfort <<= $stats.k_mascComfort>> · Rel Arjun <<= $stats.rel_kavya_arjun>> · Drawn to male frame <<= $stats.k_sexM>></div>

<p class="lede">Swaps: <<= $swapCount>> · barrier <<= $barrierIntegrity>>%. Discoveries logged: <<= ($discoveries.arjun.length + $discoveries.kavya.length)>>. Period countdown: five days.</p>

